<title>UK: TABLE - N.Ireland Electric year pretax drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE - N.Ireland Electric year pretax drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		     (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.6		   vs 58.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 15.4		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 20.9		   vs 19.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     59.8		   vs 107.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   560.9		  vs 524.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results included a restructuring charge of 50.6 million stg in the latest year.</p>
<p>Operating profit before exceptionals was 109.1 million stg versus 105.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 113.3 to 121.0 million stg, excluding exceptionals.</p>
<p>Full company name - Northern Ireland Electricity Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
